OL,3,AIceland EU referendum on a knife edge
OL,4,Aas counting continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Kristrun Frostadottir's
OL,7,Fcentre-left government promised to hold
OL,8,Fa referendum by 2027, but brought it
OL,9,Fforward because of international
OL,10,Ftensions, including US President Donald
OL,11,FTrump's threats against Greenland.
OL,13,FHowever, debate in this island nation
OL,14,Fof almost 400,000 people centred more
OL,15,Fon its fishing industry rather than
OL,16,Fsecurity concerns.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
